                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Plate with two holes / OPTIMIZATION
Default: two radius-1 holes centered at (4,3) and (8,3), with preserved end strips.
Example units: mm, N; E=210000 N/mm2, nu=0.3, thickness=2 mm. Each load: (0,-1,0) N.
Illustrative data: use your actual material and loads. No automatic yield check.</item>
